          "text": "Description: On May 6, 1978, around 10:50 PM, several people observed a stationary bright object in the sky for several minutes. In a spherical shape and orange in color, it had irregular brightness. It disappeared as it moved silently on a south-north-west trajectory. These people were likely witnesses to the passage of a satellite.",
